[]($section)

I graduated in 2023 with a PhD in computational fluid dynamics.
Since then, I have been working as a data scientist in an Australian tech company in the travel industry.

I enjoy gaming and following emergent technologies like Zig and WebGPU.
I also love playing DanceDanceRevolution.

